# Changelog

## 2026-05-19
- Ran class-specific low-score threshold ablations on KITTI MOT sequences `0019` and `0020`; the best no-validation Pedestrian setting was `official_mot_pedlow035_peddist15` with Pedestrian `HOTA=35.391`, `MOTA=24.413`, `IDF1=56.201`, while Car stayed unchanged at `HOTA=54.315`, `IDF1=68.337`.
- Ran low-score gate ablations around `--pedestrian-low-score-thresh 0.35`; `--low-score-max-distance-pedestrian 1.5` gave the best Pedestrian HOTA/IDF1 tradeoff, while IoU/cost gates improved precision and Car metrics but reduced Pedestrian association quality.
- Ran fallback score and fallback max-frame ablations around the Pedestrian-gated setup; fallback scores `0.05`, `0.10`, `0.15`, and `0.20` were effectively tied, while `--fallback-max-frames 1` regressed Pedestrian to `HOTA=34.907`, `IDF1=55.633`.
- Ran Utonia low-score validation ablations on the Pedestrian-gated setup: `val045_sim070`, `val045_sim095`, `val050_sim095`, `val050_sim099`, `val050_sim0995`, `val050_sim0999`, and `val055_sim0995`.
- Selected `official_mot_pedlow035_peddist15_val050_sim0995` as the best current no-training Utonia MOT configuration: Car stayed unchanged (`HOTA=54.315`, `MOTA=38.393`, `IDF1=68.337`), while Pedestrian improved to `HOTA=37.108`, `MOTA=28.362`, `IDF1=59.372`, `FP=2355`, `FN=1811`, `IDSW=42`.
- Diagnostics for `official_mot_pedlow035_peddist15_val050_sim0995`: `1075` Utonia low-score validations, `218` Utonia low-score rejects (`155` similarity rejects, `63` sparse-support rejects), `84` accepted Pedestrian Utonia fallback events, and `12` rejected fallback events.
- Generated Rerun recording for the new selected Utonia MOT run on KITTI sequence `0019`, frames `000000-000249`: `data/rerun/official_mot_pedlow035_peddist15_val050_sim0995_0019_000000_000249.rrd`.
- Updated `KITTI_MOT_REPORT.md` with the low-score threshold/gate sweep, fallback score/budget sweep, Utonia low-score validation sweep, selected command, diagnostics, and new Rerun recording.
