- Added class-specific low-score continuation thresholds to `scripts/run_kitti_mot_utonia.py`: `--car-low-score-thresh` and `--pedestrian-low-score-thresh`.
- Added low-score association gates to `scripts/run_kitti_mot_utonia.py`: `--low-score-max-cost`, `--low-score-min-iou`, `--low-score-max-distance-car`, and `--low-score-max-distance-pedestrian`.
- Added optional Utonia validation for weak low-score detector updates with `--validate-low-score-utonia`, class/score filters, similarity threshold, and per-class support thresholds.
- Extended MOT diagnostics and summaries with low-score gate rejects, Utonia low-score validation counts/rejects, validation similarity, validation support, low-score distance, low-score IoU, and low-score rejection reasons.
- Verified the new low-score ablation controls compile with `conda run -n utonia python -m py_compile scripts/run_kitti_mot_utonia.py scripts/eval_kitti_mot_trackeval.py`.
- Added opt-in support-point fallback box refinement to `scripts/run_kitti_mot_utonia.py` via `--fallback-refine-box {none,support_z,support_3d}`, with dimension clamp and center-blend controls.
- Extended MOT diagnostics with fallback refinement fields: `fallback_refined`, `fallback_refine_reason`, `refined_dx`, `refined_dy`, and `refined_dz`.
- Verified the fallback refinement changes compile with `conda run -n utonia python -m py_compile scripts/run_kitti_mot_utonia.py scripts/eval_kitti_mot_trackeval.py scripts/visualize_kitti_mot_rerun.py`.
